# oracle: w483nh_isochoric_2d — fix nph in 2d, barostat on y, isochoric x keeps the area (native checks the x flag twice for 2d periodicity, so isochoric y alone stops)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS: max relative error 4.8e-14 on thermo, 4.7e-13 per atom.
units lj
dimension 2
atom_style atomic
lattice sq 0.8442
region box block 0 8 0 8 -0.5 0.5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 1.0 87287 loop geom
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix 1 all nph y 1.0 1.0 1.0 isochoric x
fix 2 all enforce2d
thermo_style custom step temp pe press pyy vol lx ly
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 10
run 60
